  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_eve03",
      "hash64": "1B951F30F6EA9DD4",
      "text": "¿Sabías que, si un Rotom posee un microondas,\\nse transforma en un Rotom Calor? ¡Qué guay!\\c\\nDicen que cambia de tipo y todo.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_eve05",
      "hash64": "1B951D30F6EA9A6E",
      "text": "Algunos Pokémon se camuflan haciéndose pasar\\npor fruta, o eso he oído.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_eve06",
      "hash64": "1B951C30F6EA98BB",
      "text": "¡A comeeer! ¿Habrá algún Nutripoder que ayude\\na sacar mejores notas?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_eve07",
      "hash64": "1B951B30F6EA9708",
      "text": "Tengo tanta hambre que ya quiero repetir,\\n¡y eso que aún no he empezado a comer!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_eve13",
      "hash64": "1B919F30F6E78E7D",
      "text": "Los bocadillos saben mucho mejor cuando los\\npreparas y los comes junto a alguien especial.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_eve14",
      "hash64": "1B919830F6E78298",
      "text": "Me encantan los bocadillos que llevan trocitos\\nde fruta dentro. ¿A ti no?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_eve18",
      "hash64": "1B919430F6E77BCC",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_eve19",
      "hash64": "1B919530F6E77D7F",
      "text": "He oído que el curri está muy de moda en cierta\\nregión del extranjero. ¿Será verdad?\\c\\n¿Y tú? ¿Has probado el curri alguna vez?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_eve20",
      "hash64": "1B9C0E30F6F09F9F",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_en01",
      "hash64": "8777D1A0A0A0094D",
      "text": "Dentro de la nevera hace frío, pero, si la tocas,\\n¡resulta que por fuera está caliente!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_en02",
      "hash64": "8777CEA0A0A00434",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_en03",
      "hash64": "8777CFA0A0A005E7",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_en04",
      "hash64": "8777CCA0A0A000CE",
      "text": "El comedor siempre está lleno de vida, sea\\nla hora que sea.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_en05",
      "hash64": "8777CDA0A0A00281",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_en09",
      "hash64": "8777C9A0A09FFBB5",
      "text": "Me encanta tomar el té con mis Pokémoncitos.\\n¡Qué forma más glamurosa de pasar el rato!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "a_sch_cafe01_en10",
      "hash64": "877B36A0A0A2EAC3",
      "text": "Tomar el té por la noche es de lo más chic.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
